# M2, member b (k10): with a into dng101b1; opens its menu among GENE-01's e_nume near the entrance while a fights
# them beside it and is hit there; then walks about near the entrance (fighting the e_nume) while a
# reads the map recorder far away. Its menu opens a few steps from GENE-01's spawn point (-285, 240), which a
# starts on the entrance mat: from (-300, 335) the e_nume sometimes went for a instead and b was never hit
# (run 20261104_150825). From (-296, 268) b was hit 2452 and 3095 frames after its menu opened (int-021's runs
# 20261118_095934 and 093330: the e_nume went for a first, a's HP 49 -> 18), so the wait is 3600 frames: a's map
# reading, which b's wander below must still see, began 3500 and 4240 frames after b's menu in those runs.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@91
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log in the field
explore matz00 yes 2 until stage=dng101b1,control
log b in the dungeon
goto -296 268 8 fail stagechange
menu until menu=1 fail stagechange
idle until lost>=1 fail stagechange,menu=0,frames>=3600
log b was hit in its menu
idle until frames>=120 fail stagechange,menu=0
shot b_hit_in_menu
menu close until menu=0 fail stagechange
wander -300 330 40 until scenes>=1 or frames>=14000 fail stagechange,frames>=13990
log b sees a reading the map
wander -300 330 40 until frames>=150 fail stagechange
shot b_a_map
wander -300 330 40 until scenes=0,frames>=60 or frames>=6000 fail stagechange
log b moved while a read the map
idle until frames>=300
